  "contract": {
    "version": 11,
    "axes": 21,
    "accounting": "All axes cumulative conservative consumed plus reserved; includes payload/storage allowance, no process RSS/live-disk claim.",
    "policy": "Native trusted network configuration only, enabled default dormant outside this helper; immutable rooted policy/ruleset/interval/caps/counts.",
    "guarantee": "Baseline consumes exact resource10 once and reserves per-kind future envelopes. Public reserved debit requires actor == binding.producer; native authenticates that actor. Owned paid actions move only that subject reserve to consumed. Public challenger court/DA request/chunk attempts spend that challenger ordinary unreserved pool, never producer guarantees or subject attempt slots. Close/failure refunds nothing. New block resets block consumed and retains all remaining current-interval guarantees. Trusted new network interval clears interval actor/network totals after old subject deadlines and retains lifetime bindings/commitments.",
    "future_count_order": [
      "Metadata",
      "DARequest",
      "DAAnswer",
      "Court",
      "Chunk",
      "Close"
    ],
    "chunk_semantic": "One bounded whole assembled finish envelope uses independently derived CLASS complete filing bound+16384 outer bytes, native restore+completecourt+assembly metadata. Distinct smaller per-fragment delta/count/aggregate-byte and mature-paid-seal protected map remain required for native transport.",
    "scope_binding": "Full class-max scope9 roots price native court/restore, explicit independently derived exact-job scope9/resource10 roots bind reference job. Exact frozen program_root_v1, PCroot, input/job/requester/producer/policy/interval/deadline/admitted quota-plan root remain immutable and distinct.",
    "restored_plan": "Canonical constant-size record root expected solely from authenticated native admitted row, never from action carrier. SDK/native admission independently derives before storing.",
    "fused_factory": "Only pub(crate) freshly independently checked private execution class owns canonical program/PC/max scope. Reuses that max scope and independently derives actual resource10 once; no public raw/stored scope shortcut. Public quota factory remains independent.",
    "expired_terminal": "Any authenticated public bond may pay a fixed CURRENT ordinary close envelope after immutable liability expiry. A private nonwire prepaid token binds the exact current epoch, subject and constant debit summaries. Failed body keeps debit and old subject stays open. Mark closed only with exact private terminal book/class after genuine atomic native original escrow/UTXO transition. No old baseline/guarantee/refund is recreated. Unclaimed job creates no quota subject; native permanent job/nonce guards duplicate money.",
    "retained_catalogue": "max_subjects bounds retained quota rows; a paid one-row collection removes only a closed earlier-interval subject with a private checked token from authenticated native permanent nonce and exact conserved terminal book. Same-interval collection is refused; current consumed/reserved counters never refunded; no quota tombstone map. Native must retain compact exact terminal aux87 and permanent request/nonce aux88 forever, independently of quota GC. Native persistent index/terminal compaction and consensus counters still need integration.",
    "baseline_admission": "Public debit refuses BaselineJob. Sole public admit_baseline requires private CheckedQuotaAdmission minted by exact genuine Funded original book, fresh checked can_admit class and nonwire native aux87/88 anchor; no carrier flags. All seven root/index/terminal mismatches refuse. Rooted original plan/subject interval remains mandatory.",
    "current_terminal": "Generic public debit refuses Close. Sole debit_terminal prepays bounded exact current Close envelope and returns private token; any failed body keeps consumed/attempt and leaves subject open. Court/DA can still consume their own guarantees. mark_terminal_closed requires exact private current counter/epoch/producer token and private checked native original terminal book/permanent nonce index, after genuine atomic original escrow/UTXO transition. Stale token, duplicate Close/mark and double payout refuse. Remaining allowance is retained; no terminal refund.",
    "native_restore": "Native MUST use from_rooted_bytes(bytes,policy,expected_native_state_root) with expected root independently authenticated from actual journal/state anchor. from_bytes checks bounded codec/conservation only. Locally conserved erased counters/old rows/increased guarantee fail against original native root.",
    "future_native_tariff": "Public factory independently derives CLASS-max scope and exact native9 restore formula B*1024+PCcount*8832+scope metadata work+serialized scope bytes*64+scheduledN*4096+65536. Private fused class reuses checked native_restore_work. Court/wholeChunk use full CLASS-max complete API W/F/S. Native post upper cap:16KiB fixed typed evidence/post/outer overhead+4*(P+1 decoder orL encoder)+64*ceil(P/1024). Native must guard stored post extent BEFORE clone/decode. Court metadata=restore+64*(postcap+assembled)+64*(assembled+1024). WholeChunk adds64*(32KiB+3*assembled+1024), with assembled=classcomplete.filing+16KiB. Copies/hash/validation/container/peak axes include stored post IO separately. No reference MAC baseline repeated; no PWU reward rights."
  },
